faq:
  - q: Do we need to clean data before switching?
    a: Clean what you intend to keep. Open jobs, active customers, your catalogue and live AMCs matter most.
  - q: Will the team resist?
    a: Resistance drops when each person sees only their own work and the system saves them a call or a sheet.
  - q: Can we keep using WhatsApp?
    a: Yes. WhatsApp conversations can be logged on the enquiry, so the chat becomes part of the record.
